---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-slate-700/40 mt-12">
  <div class="max-w-page mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-10 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-sm text-slate-600">
    <div>
      <h4 class="font-serif text-bone-100 mb-2">Lichen Atlas</h4>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed">A field-research atlas of lichens colonizing historical cemeteries. Documentation generated by an AI-assisted pipeline; subject to morphology- and OCR-level verification.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4 class="font-serif text-bone-100 mb-2">Project</h4>
      <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs">
        <li>«Lichen on Tombstone · חזזית על מצבה»</li>
        <li>Bio-Design — Bezalel M.Des</li>
        <li>Maayan Magenheim · {year}</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4 class="font-serif text-bone-100 mb-2">Source &amp; references</h4>
      <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs">
        <li>Galun &amp; Haluwani (1977) <em>Lichens on tombstones in Jerusalem</em></li>
        <li>Eisler &amp; Gräf (2023) <em>Der historische Friedhof der Tempelgesellschaft in Jerusalem</em></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
